    "1. 对话内容：包括用户输入的文本与 AI 生成的回复，用于上下文连续对话与缓存命中加速。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 对话内容：包括用户输入的文本与 AI 生成的回复，用于上下文连续对话与缓存命中加速。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 對話內容：包括用戶輸入的文字與 AI 生成的回覆，用於上下文連續對話與快取命中加速。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. Conversation content: includes text you enter and AI-generated replies, used for continuous context and cache acceleration."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. 健康数据：包括心率、睡眠时长、步数等，仅在用户明确授权 HealthKit 后读取，用于生成个性化健康洞察。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 健康数据：包括心率、睡眠时长、步数等，仅在用户明确授权 HealthKit 后读取，用于生成个性化健康洞察。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 健康資料：包括心率、睡眠時長、步數等，僅在用戶明確授權 HealthKit 後讀取，用於生成個人化健康洞察。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. Health data: includes heart rate, sleep duration, steps, etc., read only after you explicitly authorize HealthKit, used to generate personalized health insights."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. 使用统计：包括性能埋点（如请求延迟、token 数）与崩溃日志，用于持续优化 App 体验。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. 使用统计：包括性能埋点（如请求延迟、token 数）与崩溃日志，用于持续优化 App 体验。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. 使用統計：包括效能埋點（如請求延遲、token 數）與崩潰紀錄，用於持續最佳化 App 體驗。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. Usage statistics: includes performance metrics (e.g. request latency, token count) and crash logs, used to continuously improve the app experience."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. DeepSeek API：用于对话生成，用户输入文本会上传至 DeepSeek 服务端处理。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. DeepSeek API：用于对话生成，用户输入文本会上传至 DeepSeek 服务端处理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. DeepSeek API：用於對話生成，用戶輸入文字會上傳至 DeepSeek 伺服器處理。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. DeepSeek API: used for chat generation; text you enter is uploaded to DeepSeek servers for processing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. 阿里云百炼 Qwen API：用于对话生成，用户输入文本会上传至阿里云服务端处理。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 阿里云百炼 Qwen API：用于对话生成，用户输入文本会上传至阿里云服务端处理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 阿里雲百鍊 Qwen API：用於對話生成，用戶輸入文字會上傳至阿里雲伺服器處理。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. Alibaba Cloud Bailian Qwen API: used for chat generation; text you enter is uploaded to Alibaba Cloud servers for processing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Bugly：用于崩溃监控，仅上报崩溃堆栈与匿名设备信息，不包含用户对话内容与个人身份信息。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. Bugly：用于崩溃监控，仅上报崩溃堆栈与匿名设备信息，不包含用户对话内容与个人身份信息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. Bugly：用於崩潰監控，僅上報崩潰堆疊與匿名裝置資訊，不包含用戶對話內容與個人身份資訊。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. Bugly: used for crash monitoring; only crash stacks and anonymous device info are reported, not conversation content or personal identity information."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. 查看已收集数据：可在「设置 - 调试面板」查看最近的请求与响应。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 查看已收集数据：可在「设置 - 调试面板」查看最近的请求与响应。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 查看已收集資料：可在「設定 - 除錯面板」查看最近的請求與回應。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. View collected data: recent requests and responses can be viewed in Settings - Debug Panel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. 删除对话记录：可在会话列表中删除任意对话，相关数据会从本地数据库移除。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 删除对话记录：可在会话列表中删除任意对话，相关数据会从本地数据库移除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 刪除對話紀錄：可在對話列表中刪除任意對話，相關資料會從本地資料庫移除。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. Delete conversation records: any conversation can be deleted from the conversation list; related data is removed from the local database."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. 撤回 HealthKit 授权：可在「系统设置 - 隐私 - 健康」中撤回对 AI Builder 的授权。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. 撤回 HealthKit 授权：可在「系统设置 - 隐私 - 健康」中撤回对 AI Builder 的授权。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. 撤回 HealthKit 授權：可在「系統設定 - 隱私 - 健康」中撤回對 AI Builder 的授權。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. Revoke HealthKit authorization: you can revoke AI Builder's authorization in System Settings - Privacy - Health."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4. 关闭遥测上报：可在「设置 - 调试面板 - 立即上报」控制上报行为，本地缓冲不强制上报。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4. 关闭遥测上报：可在「设置 - 调试面板 - 立即上报」控制上报行为，本地缓冲不强制上报。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4. 關閉遙測上報：可在「設定 - 除錯面板 - 立即上報」控制上報行為，本地緩衝不強制上報。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4. Disable telemetry upload: upload behavior can be controlled in Settings - Debug Panel - Upload Now; local buffering does not force uploads."
          }
        }
      }
    },
